    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "P. Marry & associates presents to the market this three/four bedroom semi-detached extended property situated in the mature and popular St. Patricks close development. Located adjacent to Skerries railway station and within easy walking distance of all amenities including schools, shops, beach etc. this property , which has been well maintained throughout, is sure to attract a host of interested buyers looking for their ideal home.\r\n\r\nVIEWING IS HIGHLY RECOMMENDED."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance porch:        Tiled floor\r\n\r\nEntrance hall: (3.31m x 1.82m)      Telephone point, smoke alarm, understairs storage\r\n\r\nLiving room: (3.91m x 3.64m)         Feature fireplace, coving, ceiling rose, T.V. point\r\n\r\nExtended kitchen/dining room:\r\n(L-Shaped)\r\nKitchen area: (2.59m X 6.00m) Wall & floor mounted units, plumbed for washing machine, part tiled walls, tiled floor, access to guest W.C. & W.H.B. and access to rear garden, \r\nDining area: (3.25m X 3.64m) feature brick fireplace, wood panelled chimney breast.\r\n\r\nFamily/T.V. room: (4.73m X 2.55m)                 T.V. point, access to guest W.C. & W.H.B.\r\n\r\nDownstairs bathroom: (2.07m X 2.14m)          W.C., W.H.B.,  Shower unit with electric shower, tiled walls, filed floor.\r\n\r\nLanding:        Access to attic, smoke alarm\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: (3.96m X 2.74m)         Built-in wardrobes\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: (3.96m X 4.05m)         Built-in wardrobes, telephone point.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: (2.38m X 2.64m)         Built-in wardrobes\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom: (2.22m X 1.59m)         W.C., W.H.B., Bath, tiled walls, tiled floor, hot press, wall heater.\r\n\r\nGardens:\r\nFRONT: lawn, driveway, cobblelock parking area, mature planted areas.\r\nREAR: Not overlooked, block shed, walled-in, mature planted areas, side entrance, outside tap, outside ight."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "SPECIAL FEATURES:\r\nExtended kitchen\r\nDownstairs W.C. & shower room.\r\nOil Fired central heating\r\nDouble glazed throughout\r\nAlarm\r\nNot overlooked\r\nCul-de-sac location\r\nTwo minutes walk from railway station"
      },
